# Optional. Copy this file to .env and fill in whichever key you want to use
# for the plan-drafting provider (Setup -> Connect a provider). None of these
# are required — PromptMeter's cost/token estimates work for every model with
# no key at all; a key only unlocks having that provider draft your prompt's
# step-by-step plan instead of the built-in keyword heuristic.
#
# A key you paste into the Setup page always wins over the value here (and is
# encrypted at rest on Windows via DPAPI — see ARCHITECTURE.md §5.8). This
# file is only a fallback for when nothing is saved there yet, e.g. right
# after a fresh clone or an "Erase everything." It is never sent anywhere
# except the one provider it names.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
OPENAI_API_KEY=
GEMINI_API_KEY=
